  "id": "participatory-research",
  "term": "participatory research",
  "definition": "Participatory research is an approach to research that involves the public in the research process rather than leaving decisions entirely to researchers or institutions. It can be used mainly to improve research outcomes, or more transformatively to support social change through a fairer sharing of decision-making power between researchers and the public.",
